      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Paste one active file from design/prompts/README.md into a fresh session. F1 and F2 may overlap only because F2 adds no tables.\nThe critical validation is M3: if Claude Code and Cursor cannot map to one content-free event contract, stop and revise the\ncapability abstraction. Do not build a gateway, ClickHouse pipeline, DLP stack or cost system to make the MVP feel larger.\nA slice closes only when its gate is demonstrated and PROJECT_STATE.md records migrations as written versus actually applied.",
      "originalText": "Paste one active file from design/prompts/README.md into a fresh session. F1 and F2 may overlap only because F2 adds no tables.\nThe critical validation is M3: if Claude Code and Cursor cannot map to one content-free event contract, stop and revise the\ncapability abstraction. Do not build a gateway, ClickHouse pipeline, DLP stack or cost system to make the MVP feel larger.\nA slice closes only when its gate is demonstrated and PROJECT_STATE.md records migrations as written versus actually applied.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
